    {
      "text": "A drawing of a smartphone displaying a 'COVID-19 Vaccination Certificate' with the WHO emblem, two stacked entries dated 'COVID-19 | 21 May 2021' and 'COVID-19 18 June 2021', and a QR code. In Figure 2 it is format 5, a DDCC:VS held on a smartphone. On the rendered page the WHO emblem and title are covered by the label 'National COVID-19 Certificate'.",
